  "objectives": [
    "Represent a two-dimensional vector by its magnitude and direction and by its horizontal and vertical components.",
    "Add vectors graphically using the tip-to-tail method and identify the resultant vector.",
    "Decompose and reconstruct vectors using right-triangle trigonometry.",
    "Explain why projectile horizontal and vertical motions are independent when gravity acts only vertically.",
    "Describe how horizontal velocity, vertical velocity, and position evolve during projectile flight, including the instant of maximum height.",
    "Predict how launch angle and launch speed affect trajectory, range, and maximum height, including the angle for maximum range at fixed speed."
